# Verification

Do not verify changes with browser actions or browser tools. Do not open the app, click through flows, or take screenshots.

After code changes, run both and report the results:

- `bun run lint`
- `bun ./node_modules/typescript/lib/tsc.js -b --pretty false`

`bunx tsc` fails here because no Node version is set. Run the TypeScript compiler through Bun as above.
